'''Ender Relic''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Accessory]] that can be crafted after reaching {{coll|Enderman Slayer 7}}. It is a direct upgrade from {{Item|Ender Artifact}}, and reduces the damage taken from {{mt|Ender}} mobs by {{Green|25%}}.

